# WeChat Monitor Bot

A production-oriented WeCom message monitoring and auto-reply platform with a FastAPI backend, PostgreSQL persistence, Redis queue, AI-powered response generation, and a React admin dashboard.

## What this project includes
- Enterprise WeCom callback integration
- Signature validation and message processing
- Rule-based message replies
- AI reply generation using OpenAI-compatible APIs
- Message history storage in PostgreSQL
- Redis-backed queue and cache support
- React admin dashboard for viewing messages and rules
- Docker Compose deployment for local dev / demo

## Architecture

- Backend: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + async PostgreSQL
- Queue / cache: Redis
- AI: OpenAI-compatible API (optional)
- Frontend: React + Vite
- Deployment: Docker Compose

